          "path": "_m/9/q/d/v/mariposa-grove-wp/mariposa-grove-yosemite-nation.jpg",
          "filename": "Mariposa Grove, Yosemite National Park (5636649489).jpg",
          "caption": "The California Sequoia is able to grow only on the cold, foggy western slopes of the Sierra Nevada Range (though I saw them grow at Kew Gardens in London, England, as well). Although Sequoia National Park, three hours' drive to the southeast, has more spectacular specimens, Mariposa Grove is spectacular enough.",
